  "worked_solution": "To find the coordinates of $P,$ we start at the origin, move $2$ units *right*, and then $4$ units *up*. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129504/assets/e239fc0e990a133f43f77c608a731f23b5afde0e76950480980be368c616f1c1.png)\n\nThe coordinates of $P$ are $(2,4).$ Therefore, the $x$-coordinate of $P$ is $2.$",
